desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "solidity"
	title: "源码扫描：Solidity tx.origin 鉴权"
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Solidity tx.origin 鉴权"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-solidity-tx-origin"
	risk: "access-control"
	cwe: "CWE-477"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
用 tx.origin 做鉴权可以被中间合约转发调用绕过。

该语言的 struct/ssa 前端还没有接入。当前只保留 source 规则，builtin verify 会跳过 pending-language 目录。

### 风险类型
access-control

### 影响
命中说明文件中出现了该危险写法。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配。
### 参考
- CWE-477
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用 msg.sender。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://bad.sol": <<<POS
contract C { function f() public { require(tx.origin == msg.sender); } }

POS
	"safefile://ok.sol": <<<NEG
contract C { function f() public { require(msg.sender != address(0)); } }

NEG
)
${*.sol}.pattern_regex(/tx\.origin/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "源码扫描：Solidity tx.origin 鉴权",
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Solidity tx.origin 鉴权",
	message: "源码扫描：Solidity tx.origin 鉴权",
	risk: "access-control",
}
